// src/v4/compiler/00_compile.dag
//
// Scope: pipeline orchestrator — wires tokenize → parse → normalize → resolve → infer → emit
// Anchor: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Compiler (general phase architecture)
//        into a single compile() entry point. Called by bin/main.dag and by
//        every end-to-end TestClaim.
//
// Owns:
//   - compile: (Source, TargetSpec) -> Result<TargetSource, Diagnostic>
//     (the top-level entry; fail-fast on any stage's Diagnostic)
//
// Consumes:
//   - compiler/01_tokenize.dag → 05_emit.dag (every stage)
//   - std/diagnostic.dag for error propagation
//   - extdeps/languages/*.dag for TargetSpec
//
// Status: scaffold — fill per TASKS.md T-10 (paired with emit implementation;
//         orchestrator is the consumer of every prior stage)
// Brief: see BRIEF_TEMPLATE.md; this file's I/O contract is the immutable
// contract for the worker. Splitting this file requires explicit operator
// ratification (substrate extension = stop signal).


module v4.compiler.compile

